Create actor framework foundation in Go, porting patterns from havequick.

## Goals
- actor/ package with Mailbox ring buffer and overflow tracking
- msg/ package with core message types (BinanceTick, CoinbaseTick, SpreadSignal, TradeIntent)
- actors/ package with strategy actors (ingest, indicator, spread, risk, execution)
- iso/ package for categorical infrastructure (projections, law verification)

